lays.\n\nReason: The 8-card straight (♣3, ♥4, ♦5, ♦6, ♦7, ♣8, ♥9, ♥10) is a high-value move that clears 8 cards in one turn. Since opponents have 17 cards each, this aggressive play pressures them while leveraging my landlord advantage of going first.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3", "♥4", "♦5", "♦6", "♦7", "♣8", "♥9", "♥10"]}'}
